#ASSERT `s 333.2(5) an order of forfeiture is barred` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 334 punishment for theft`
-- testamentary instrument (s 2), value in dollars, another provision otherwise provides, the s 787(1) general penalty
-- value not more than $5,000 (exactly $5,000 included): (b) indictable up to two years, or summary
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST FALSE) 5000 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS JUST (LIST `ccc12 fixture indictable, up to two years`, `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`)
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST FALSE) 4999 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS JUST (LIST `ccc12 fixture indictable, up to two years`, `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`)
-- more than $5,000: (a) indictable up to ten years, or summary
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST FALSE) 5001 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS JUST (LIST `ccc12 fixture indictable, up to ten years`, `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`)
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST FALSE) 5000.01 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS JUST (LIST `ccc12 fixture indictable, up to ten years`, `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`)
-- a testamentary instrument, whatever its value
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST TRUE) 10 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS JUST (LIST `ccc12 fixture indictable, up to ten years`, `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`)
-- the testamentary answer is not given: a value above $5,000 settles it, a lower value does not
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` NOTHING 6000 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS JUST (LIST `ccc12 fixture indictable, up to ten years`, `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`)
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` NOTHING 100 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS NOTHING
-- "Except where otherwise provided by law"
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST FALSE) 6000 TRUE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST TRUE) 10 TRUE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty` EQUALS NOTHING
-- the class of the offence, from the limbs: both indictable and punishable on summary conviction
#ASSERT `ccc12 the class of the offence from its possible limbs` (`s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST FALSE) 100 FALSE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`) EQUALS JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`
#ASSERT `ccc12 the class of the offence from its possible limbs` (`s 334 the punishment for the person who commits theft` (JUST FALSE) 100 TRUE `ccc12 fixture general summary penalty`) EQUALS NOTHING

